@host = http://localhost:8080

### Clientes
GET {{host}}/customers

###
POST {{host}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nova Loja", "document": "11.222.333/0001-44", "type": "PREMIUM", "email": "contato@novaloja.com.br" }

###
PATCH {{host}}/customers/9/deactivate

### Coletas — cadastrar
POST {{host}}/pickups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1, "region": "NORTH", "address": "Rua das Flores, 100", "packageCount": 12, "manualPriority": 8 }

### Coletas — lote
POST {{host}}/pickups/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "customerId": 2, "region": "SOUTH", "address": "Av. Brasil, 500", "packageCount": 4 },
  { "customerId": 3, "region": "EAST", "address": "", "packageCount": 2 }
]

### Coletas — listar (estratégia padrão)
GET {{host}}/pickups

### Coletas — listar por tipo de cliente
GET {{host}}/pickups?strategy=customer-type&status=PENDING

### Coletas — status
PATCH {{host}}/pickups/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SCHEDULED" }

### Coletas — reagendar
POST {{host}}/pickups/1/reschedule

### Coletas — comprovante
PUT {{host}}/pickups/1/proof
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

conteudo-do-comprovante

### Coletas — resumo
GET {{host}}/pickups/summary

### Entregas
GET {{host}}/deliveries?status=DELAYED&page=1&size=10

###
GET {{host}}/deliveries?driver=silva&from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31

###
POST {{host}}/deliveries/10/occurrences
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "DAMAGED_PACKAGE", "notes": "Caixa amassada" }

### Reembolsos
GET {{host}}/refunds?status=REQUESTED

###
POST {{host}}/refunds
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deliveryId": 10, "reason": "DAMAGED_PACKAGE", "amount": 35.50, "requestedBy": "sac.atendimento" }

###
POST {{host}}/refunds/14/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approvedBy": "roberto.gerente" }

###
POST {{host}}/refunds/15/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rejectedBy": "roberto.gerente", "notes": "Sem evidência" }

###
GET {{host}}/refunds/report

### Janelas de coleta
GET {{host}}/pickup-windows?date=2026-10-06

### Docas
GET {{host}}/dock-appointments

###
POST {{host}}/dock-appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "carrier": "Transportes Rápido Sul", "truckPlate": "ABC1D23", "dock": 2, "date": "2026-10-07", "startTime": "10:00" }

###
PUT {{host}}/dock-appointments/1/attachment
X-File-Name: nf-12345.pdf
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

conteudo-da-nota

### Manifestos
POST {{host}}/manifests
Content-Type: application/json

< ../samples/manifests/manifesto-2026-10-02-rt-centro-0210.json

###
GET {{host}}/manifests
